  "soru": "Kastamonu'daki Küre Dağları'nın bir ormanında canlıların beslenme ilişkisi besin ağıyla gösterilmiştir. Oklar, enerjinin yenen canlıdan yiyen canlıya akış yönünü gösterir. Canlılar yalnızca şemada oklarla gösterilen canlılarla beslenmektedir.\n**Şahine doğrudan ya da dolaylı olarak enerji sağlayan, şahin dışındaki canlı sayısı kaçtır?**",
  "gorsel": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 503 162\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Meşe, palamut böceği, sincap, geyik, ağaçkakan, kurt ve şahinden oluşan besin ağı\"><defs><marker id=\"okfenbz074\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"62.0\" y1=\"70.5\" x2=\"129.2\" y2=\"45.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#okfenbz074)\"/><line x1=\"62.0\" y1=\"81.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"81.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#okfenbz074)\"/><line x1=\"62.0\" y1=\"91.5\" x2=\"145.0\" y2=\"123.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#okfenbz074)\"/><line x1=\"243.0\" y1=\"27.0\" x2=\"291.0\" y2=\"27.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#okfenbz074)\"/><line x1=\"380.2\" y1=\"45.0\" x2=\"433.0\" y2=\"67.6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#okfenbz074)\"/><line x1=\"212.0\" y1=\"81.0\" x2=\"433.0\" y2=\"81.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#okfenbz074)\"/><line x1=\"208.0\" y1=\"135.0\" x2=\"310.5\" y2=\"135.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#okfenbz074)\"/><rect x=\"10\" y=\"66\" width=\"49\" height=\"30\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"var(--dolgu)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"34.5\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Meşe</text><rect x=\"113\" y=\"12\" width=\"127\" height=\"30\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"var(--dolgu)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"176.5\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Palamut böceği</text><rect x=\"144\" y=\"66\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"var(--dolgu)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"176.5\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Sincap</text><rect x=\"148\" y=\"120\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"var(--dolgu)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"176.5\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Geyik</text><rect x=\"294\" y=\"12\" width=\"88\" height=\"30\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"var(--dolgu)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"338\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Ağaçkakan</text><rect x=\"313.5\" y=\"120\" width=\"49\" height=\"30\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"var(--dolgu)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"338\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Kurt</text><rect x=\"436\" y=\"66\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"var(--dolgu)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"464.5\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Şahin</text></svg>",
